<overview>
<p>The branth is a large flying reptile native to the Free Worlds League world of Lopez, where early human explorers compared the winged, scaled creatures to the dragons of Terran mythology. Averaging 720 kilograms and capable of carrying one or two riders aloft, the branth was first pressed into military service by FWLM formations operating on Lopez and nearby worlds. Taming a branth requires specially trained keepers, as even domesticated specimens remain powerful and unpredictable. Attempts to export branth off-world have met with limited success due to the species' extreme susceptibility to disease, though immune system boosters developed by the late thirty-first century improved survival rates somewhat.</p><p>Configured for civil disturbance management rather than conventional military combat, these riot control troops are trained in crowd suppression, population control, and non-lethal enforcement operations on garrison worlds during periods of unrest or political transition.</p>
</overview>

<notes>
Intro date selected as common date for Sonic Stunner weapon
